# The one tool scripts/check-vectors.sh needs beyond the standard library.
# check-vectors.requirements.txt is compiled from this file and pins every
# dependency with the SHA256 of every distribution; the command that built it
# is at its top. Bump the version and the --exclude-newer date together, and
# only to a release at least 14 days old: the date keeps every dependency at
# least that old too. check-jsonschema is Apache 2.0 licensed.
check-jsonschema==0.38.2
